+# Plan — a donut layout for the top languages card
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 The donut layout renders one path per language and a legend with each language's percent (tests/renderTopLanguages.test.js) [AC-1] [AC-2]
+- [ ] 1.2 The layout helpers place the donut and size the card for each layout (tests/renderTopLanguages.test.js) [AC-3]
+
+## 2. The card
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Add the donut geometry helpers and the donut renderer (src/cards/top-languages-card.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 Trim the languages once for every layout, and size each layout from the trimmed list (src/cards/top-languages-card.js)
+- [ ] 2.3 Add `donut` to the layout type and document it (src/cards/types.d.ts, readme.md)
